EITHER WAY THE BRACKET IS A REFIT QUESTION: it was bisected at the DEFAULT
parameters on a model with NO pump, and the pump moves the very row
(deep D14C) the bisection was built on. Re-derive it at the refit rather
than inherit it -- calibrate.R's own comment asks for exactly that.


