READ: at the bracket's BOTTOM the extra pump is bought by ATMOSPHERIC
RADIOCARBON, not by the gradient rows -- which LOSE. Mode N moves no carbon
into the ocean (the sink row is identical down every column above), but it
does carry 14C down, so an under-ventilated column uses the pump as a bomb-14C
sink. That is a real entanglement and it is OFF THE POSTERIOR'S SUPPORT: kz
pins to the bracket's TOP (P2), and there the same channel changes sign.


